                                "sense_id": "06975c3a-8e31-3582-a8d7-0635be7e8b30",
                                "text": "But now, after the first close, in which we lose the fall—with straight right-handers we keep him at off-fighting--and that was a gush of blood from his smeller."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1ee58602-16fb-4c20-9768-5c8b23048912",
                                "sense_id": "06975c3a-8e31-3582-a8d7-0635be7e8b30",
                                "text": "After which Buttons landed four blows, one on each peeper, one on the smeller, and one on the mug."
                            }
